
==============================================================================
PUNTO 38 — Bloqueos de tabla y de fila
==============================================================================

>> 38.1 LOCK TABLE ... IN ACCESS EXCLUSIVE MODE bloquea hasta las lecturas
[  0.01s] A: LOCK TABLE reserva IN ACCESS EXCLUSIVE MODE
[  0.01s] B: ejecuta  SELECT tarifa_noche FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000
        pg_stat_activity: ('A', 'Client', 'ClientRead', [], 'LOCK TABLE reserva IN ACCESS EXCLUSIVE MODE')
        pg_stat_activity: ('B', 'Lock', 'relation', [1156], 'SELECT tarifa_noche FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000')
        pg_locks: ('A', 'transactionid', '', 'ExclusiveLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('A', 'relation', 'reserva', 'AccessExclusiveLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('B', 'relation', 'reserva', 'AccessShareLock', False)
[  1.52s] A: COMMIT
[  1.52s] B: terminó  -> [(Decimal('422.68'),)]

>> 38.2 LOCK TABLE ... IN SHARE MODE: deja leer, bloquea escribir
[  1.52s] A: LOCK TABLE reserva IN SHARE MODE
[  1.52s] B: ejecuta  SELECT tarifa_noche FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000
[  1.52s] B: terminó  -> [(Decimal('422.68'),)]
[  1.52s] B: ejecuta  UPDATE reserva SET observaciones = 'B' WHERE reserva_id = 1000
        pg_stat_activity: ('A', 'Client', 'ClientRead', [], 'LOCK TABLE reserva IN SHARE MODE')
        pg_stat_activity: ('B', 'Lock', 'relation', [1156], "UPDATE reserva SET observaciones = 'B' WHERE reserva_id = 10")
        pg_locks: ('A', 'relation', 'reserva', 'ShareLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('B', 'relation', 'reserva', 'RowExclusiveLock', False)
[  3.03s] A: COMMIT
[  3.03s] B: terminó  -> None

>> 38.3 Bloqueo compartido de fila (FOR SHARE): otro FOR SHARE convive, UPDATE espera
unknown PostgreSQL timezone: 'AMERICA0'; will use UTC
[  3.03s] A: SELECT ... FOR SHARE (reserva 1000)
[  3.03s] B: ejecuta  SELECT reserva_id FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000 FOR SHARE
[  3.04s] B: terminó  -> [(1000,)]
[  3.04s] B: ejecuta  UPDATE reserva SET observaciones = 'B' WHERE reserva_id = 1000
        pg_stat_activity: ('A', 'Client', 'ClientRead', [], 'SELECT * FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000 FOR SHARE')
        pg_stat_activity: ('B', 'Lock', 'transactionid', [1156], "UPDATE reserva SET observaciones = 'B' WHERE reserva_id = 10")
        pg_locks: ('A', 'relation', 'reserva', 'RowShareLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('A', 'transactionid', '', 'ExclusiveLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('B', 'relation', 'reserva', 'RowExclusiveLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('B', 'tuple', 'reserva', 'ExclusiveLock', True)
        pg_locks: ('B', 'transactionid', '', 'ShareLock', False)
[  4.54s] A: ROLLBACK
[  4.54s] B: terminó  -> None

>> 38.4 Bloqueo exclusivo de fila (FOR UPDATE): una lectura simple NO espera (MVCC), otro FOR UPDATE sí
[  4.54s] A: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (reserva 1000)
[  4.54s] B: ejecuta  SELECT tarifa_noche FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000
[  4.54s] B: terminó  -> [(Decimal('422.68'),)]
[  4.54s] B: ejecuta  SELECT tarifa_noche FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id = 1000 FOR UPDATE NO
[  4.55s] B: ERROR    -> could not obtain lock on row in relation "reserva"
[  4.55s] B: ejecuta  SELECT reserva_id FROM reserva WHERE reserva_id IN (1000,2000) FOR UPD
[  4.55s] B: terminó  -> [(2000,)]
[  4.55s] A: ROLLBACK

